  "title": "The First Multiset-Permutation Instability for the Consecutive Pattern 21435",
  "batch_label": "87",
  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "For the consecutive pattern 21435, every positive multiplicity vector of total length N<=8 is stable; at N=9 the unique unstable unordered type is {2,1^7}; for a repeated rank r in that type the occurrence polynomial is 176026+5368t+46t^2 for 1<=r<=4 and 176025+5370t+45t^2 for 5<=r<=8, and no such word has three or more occurrences.",
